64965544&sharedId=trd-us&u=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.walmart.com%2Fshop%2Fdeals%2Fearlyaccess\" data-url=\"https://www.walmart.com/shop/deals/earlyaccess\" target=\"_blank\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer-when-downgrade\" rel=\"sponsored noopener\" data-hl-processed=\"hawklinks\" data-article-category=\"televisions\" data-google-interstitial=\"false\" data-placeholder-url=\"https://goto.walmart.com/c/1943169/568844/9383?subId1=hawk-custom-tracking&sharedId=hawk-prefix&u=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.walmart.com%2Fshop%2Fdeals%2Fearlyaccess\" data-merchant-name=\"Walmart\" data-merchant-id=\"108180\" data-merchant-network=\"ImpactRadfutureusLlc\" data-merchant-url=\"walmart.com\">early access to deals for members</a></li>","sentences":[{"en":"Walmart: early access to deals for members","zh":null}]},{"html_en":"<p>Get daily insight, inspiration and deals in your inbox</p>","sentences":[{"en":"Get daily insight, inspiration and deals in your inbox","zh":"在收件箱中获取每日见解、灵感和优惠"}]},{"html_en":"<p>Sign up for breaking news, reviews, opinion, top tech deals, and more.</p>","sentences":[{"en":"Sign up for breaking news, reviews, opinion, top tech deals, and more.","zh":"订阅突发新闻、评论、观点、顶级技术交易等。"}]},{"html_en":"<p>Contributor </p>","sentences":[{"en":"Contributor","zh":"贡献者"}]},{"html_en":"<p>Writer, broadcaster, musician and kitchen gadget obsessive Carrie Marshall has been writing about tech since 1998, contributing sage advice and odd opinions to all kinds of magazines and websites as well as writing more than twenty books. Her latest, a love letter to music titled <a href=\"https://www.404ink.com/store/p/small-town-joy-carrie-marshall\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Small Town Joy</a>, is on sale now. She is the singer in spectacularly obscure Glaswegian rock band <a href=\"http://unquietmindmusic.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Unquiet Mind</a>.</p>","sentences":[{"en":"Writer, broadcaster, musician and kitchen gadget obsessive Carrie Marshall has been writing about tech since 1998, contributing sage advice and odd opinions to all kinds of magazines and websites as well as writing more than twenty books.","zh":"作家、播音员、音乐家和厨房小工具痴迷者 Carrie Marshall 自 1998 年以来一直在撰写有关科技的文章，为各种杂志和网站提供明智的建议和奇怪的意见，并撰写了二十多本书。"},{"en":"Her latest, a love letter to music titled Small Town Joy, is on sale now.","zh":"她的最新作品是一封写给音乐的情书，名为《小镇欢乐》，现已发售。"},{"en":"She is the singer in spectacularly obscure Glaswegian rock band Unquiet Mind.","zh":"她是默默无闻的格拉斯哥摇滚乐队 Unquiet Mind 的主唱。"}]}],"translated":true,"content_html_zh":"<div class=\"page\" id=\"readability-page-1\"><div id=\"content\" data-widget-type=\"contentparsed\">\n<section>\n<div>\n<figure>\n<picture data-new-v2-image=\"true\">\n<source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://cdn.mos.cms.futurecdn.net/sJnPsQvdVCKZeS5AMgMii-1920-80.jpg.webp 1920w, https://cdn.mos.cms.futurecdn.net/sJnPsQvdVCKZeS5AMgMii-1600-80.jpg.webp 1600w, https://cdn.mos.cms.futurecdn.net/sJnPsQvdVCKZeS5AMgMii-1200-80.jpg.webp 1200w, https://cdn.mos.cms.futurecdn.net/sJnPsQvdVCKZeS5AMgMii-1024-80.jpg.webp 1024w, https://cdn.mos.cms.futurecdn.net/sJnPsQvdVCKZeS5AMgMii-970-80.jpg.webp 970w, https://cdn.mos.cms.futurecdn.net/sJnPsQvdVCKZeS5AMgMii-750-80.jpg.webp 750w, https://cdn.mos.cms.futurecdn.net/sJnPsQvdVCKZeS5AMgMii-650-80.jpg.webp 650w, https://cdn.mos.cms.futurecdn.net/sJnPsQvdVCKZeS5AMgMii-480-80.jpg.webp 480w, https://cdn.mos.cms.futurecdn.net/sJnPsQvdVCKZeS5AMgMii-320-80.jpg.webp 320w\" sizes=\"(min-width: 1000px) 600px, 100vw\">\n<img src=\"https://cdn.mos.cms.futurecdn.net/sJnPsQvdVCKZeS5AMgMii.jpg\" alt=\"TCL QM7L TV on yellow background with price cut text overlay\" srcset=\"https://cdn.mos.cms.futurecdn.net/sJnPsQvdVCKZeS5AMgMii-1920-80.jpg 1920w, https://cdn.mos.cms.futurecdn.net/sJnPsQvdVCKZeS5AMgMii-1600-80.jpg 1600w, https://cdn.mos.cms.futurecdn.net/sJnPsQvdVCKZeS5AMgMii-1200-80.jpg 1200w, https://cdn.mos.cms.futurecdn.net/sJnPsQvdVCKZeS5AMgMii-1024-80.jpg 1024w, https://cdn.mos.cms.futurecdn.net/sJnPsQvdVCKZeS5AMgMii-970-80.jpg 970w, https://cdn.mos.cms.futurecdn.net/sJnPsQvdVCKZeS5AMgMii-750-80.jpg 750w, https://cdn.mos.cms.futurecdn.net/sJnPsQvdVCKZeS5AMgMii-650-80.jpg 650w, https://cdn.mos.cms.futurecdn.net/sJnPsQvdVCKZeS5AMgMii-480-80.jpg 480w, https://cdn.mos.cms.futurecdn.net/sJnPsQvdVCKZeS5AMgMii-320-80.jpg 320w\" sizes=\"(min-width: 1000px) 600px, 100vw\" data-new-v2-image=\"true\" data-original-mos=\"https://cdn.mos.cms.futurecdn.net/sJnPsQvdVCKZeS5AMgMii.jpg\" data-pin-media=\"https://cdn.mos.cms.futurecdn.net/sJnPsQvdVCKZeS5AMgMii.jpg\" data-pin-nopin=\"true\" fetchpriority=\"high\" data-component-name=\"Image\">\n</picture>\n<figcaption>（图片来源：未来）</figcaption>\n</figure></div>\n<div id=\"article-body\">\n\n<p id=\"elk-85357e20-e988-11f1-84a4-a16f8ad65bf6\">The TCL QM7L is the best mid-range TV of 2026, and right now you can get the 65-inch version with a whopping 43% price reduction: where the TCL QM7L was $1,499.99 it is now just $847.99 at Amazon. At full price the TV was a great buy. At this price it's a doorbuster, the kind of saving you'd queue up for.</p><p>• Browse the full Amazon Black Friday sale</p><p>In our in-depth TCL QM7L review we gave it 4.5 out of five stars, praising its picture quality, its gamer-friendly features (including a high refresh rate and AMD Freesync Pro) and its excellent value for money.</p><p>As our expert reviewer James Holland explained, the TCL QM7L is \"impressive with up to 2,100 local dimming zones, up to 3,000 nits at peak brightness, TCL’s anti-halo and color enhancing tech, and AI features such as the imperfect generative voice assistant in Google Gemini. The sound is still provided by Bang &amp; Olufsen and the refresh rate (and passthrough from HDMI ports) is high enough that it will make for one of the best gaming TVs for those trying to strike a balance between premium performance and price.\"</p><p>We'd quibble very slightly with Amazon's RRP here — Amazon says $1,499, but the 65-inch launch price was $1,299 — but this is still a substantial saving on a very good mid-range television that takes the price well into bargain territory.</p><h2 id=\"today-39-s-best-tcl-qm7l-deal-3\">Today's best TCL QM7L deal</h2><h2 id=\"more-black-friday-deals-in-the-us-3\">More Black Friday deals in the US</h2><ul id=\"elk-8535801e-e988-11f1-aaac-ff3e3287913a\"><li>Amazon: up to 65% off tech &amp; essentials</li><li>Best Buy: up to 50% off TVs, laptops &amp; appliances</li><li>Dell: up to $700 off laptops</li><li>Home Depot: 50% off appliances, grills &amp; tools</li><li>Lenovo: up to 50% off laptops</li><li>Lowe's: up to 30% off appliances &amp; holiday decor</li><li>Samsung: up to $1,000 off TVs &amp; phones</li><li>T-Mobile: free iPhone or Galaxy with a plan</li><li>Target: Christmas decor &amp; gifts from $7.99</li><li>Walmart: early access to deals for members</li></ul>\n</div>\n\n<div id=\"slice-container-newsletterForm-articleInbodyContent-EggnX7YwBkDbGTaSdx53iR\" data-newsletter-form-root=\"\" data-observe-viewable=\"true\" data-component-name=\"Newsletter:NewsletterForm\">\n<section>\n<p>在收件箱中获取每日见解、灵感和优惠</p>\n</section>\n<section x-data=\"newsletterForm(\n'inbodyContent',\n'https://www.techradar.com/.newsletter-subscribe/v2/submission/submit',\n'\\u007B\\u0022lang\\u0022\\u003A\\u0022EN\\u0022,\\u0022newsletterCode\\u0022\\u003A\\u0022XTR\\u002DD\\u0022,\\u0022source\\u0022\\u003A\\u002260\\u0022\\u007D',\n'opt-out',\nfalse,\n'\\u0022By\\u0020signing\\u0020up,\\u0020you\\u0020agree\\u0020to\\u0020our\\u0020\\u003Ca\\u0020href\\u003D\\\\\\u0022https\\u003A\\\\\\/\\\\\\/futureplc.com\\\\\\/terms\\u002Dconditions\\\\\\/\\\\\\u0022\\u0020target\\u003D\\\\\\u0022_blank\\\\\\u0022\\u003ETerms\\u0020of\\u0020services\\u0020\\u003C\\\\\\/a\\u003E\\u0020and\\u0020acknowledge\\u0020that\\u0020you\\u0020have\\u0020read\\u0020our\\u0020\\u003Ca\\u0020href\\u003D\\\\\\u0022https\\u003A\\\\\\/\\\\\\/futureplc.com\\\\\\/privacy\\u002Dpolicy\\\\\\u0022\\u0020target\\u003D\\\\\\u0022_blank\\\\\\u0022\\u003EPrivacy\\u0020Noti